Dalal AI - Changelog

Version 1.0.2 (Recent Refactoring)
- Extracted DOM-to-Markdown script to a standalone `response_script.js` file.
- Removed dead code (`temp_split.py`, `split_browser.py`).
- Added strict type hinting and `__future__` annotations across all core modules.
- Modernized dependency requirements (added `scikit-learn` and `numpy`).
- Fixed broken absolute imports in `main.py` CLI.
- Re-wrote all system documentation (DETAILED_DESIGN, GUIDE, README).

Version 1.0.1
- Added macOS and Linux build support via PyInstaller.
- Backward compatibility fixes for Python 3.8.

Version 1.0.0
- Initial professional release.
